{"id":"ce2c2e33d033a7de","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-skolemization.md","title":"Skolemization","display":"df-skolemization — Skolemization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-skolemization","aliases":["72-df-skolemization"],"display":"df-skolemization — Skolemization","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.5.2 print49–50/PDF61–62; rectified closed prenex specialization","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-skolemization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-skolemization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolemization — Skolemization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.5.2 print49–50/PDF61–62; rectified closed prenex specialization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 与公式构造取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\rm qf}\">\\(X_{\\rm qf}\\)</span>、结构及满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}^n\">\\(\\vec Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in V^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in V^n\\)</span> 为单射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in X_{\\rm qf}\">\\(\\theta\\in X_{\\rm qf}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta\">\\(\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta\\)</span>，空前缀时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\theta\">\\(\\varphi=\\theta\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,E\">\\(U,E\\)</span> 是下式给出的全称、存在指标集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec f\">\\(\\vec f\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的单射符号族，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f)\\cap(C\\cup F\\cup R\\cup V)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f)\\cap(C\\cup F\\cup R\\cup V)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(J\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{inc}(J)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i\">\\(r_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u_i\">\\(\\vec u_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\vec f}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\vec f}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\)</span>。矩阵序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0,\\ldots,B_n\">\\(B_0,\\ldots,B_n\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\vec f}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\vec f}\\)</span> 上的实例；旧语法对象因符号包含而属于扩充语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_k,\\ldots,K_0\">\\(K_k,\\ldots,K_0\\)</span> 是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k-j\">\\(k-j\\)</span> 递归构造的公式序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M&#39;=\\langle D,I_C&#39;,I_F&#39;,I_R&#39;\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M&#39;=\\langle D,I_C&#39;,I_F&#39;,I_R&#39;\\rangle\\)</span> 分别遍历满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_{\\vec f}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_{\\vec f}}\\)</span> 的非空结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma\\)</span> 的函数定义域仅为后者。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nU&amp;:=\\{i&lt;n:Q_i=\\forall\\},\\qquad E:=\\{i&lt;n:Q_i=\\exists\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{inc}(J)&amp;:=\\iota h\\in J^{|J|}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(h)=J\\land\\forall a&lt;b&lt;|J|\\ (h(a)&lt;h(b))],\\\\\nk&amp;:=|U|,\\qquad e:=\\operatorname{inc}(U),\\\\\nr_i&amp;:=|U\\cap i|,\\qquad\\vec u_i:=\\langle x_{\\operatorname{inc}(U\\cap i)(j)}\\rangle_{j&lt;r_i},\\\\\nC_{\\vec f}&amp;:=C\\cup\\{f_i:i\\in E\\land r_i=0\\},\\\\\nF_{\\vec f}&amp;:=F\\cup\\{f_i:i\\in E\\land r_i&gt;0\\},\\\\\na_F^{\\vec f}&amp;:=a_F\\cup\\{\\langle f_i,r_i\\rangle:i\\in E\\land r_i&gt;0\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\vec f}&amp;:=\\langle C_{\\vec f},F_{\\vec f},a_F^{\\vec f},R,a_R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nU&amp;:=\\{i&lt;n:Q_i=\\forall\\},\\qquad E:=\\{i&lt;n:Q_i=\\exists\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{inc}(J)&amp;:=\\iota h\\in J^{|J|}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(h)=J\\land\\forall a&lt;b&lt;|J|\\ (h(a)&lt;h(b))],\\\\\nk&amp;:=|U|,\\qquad e:=\\operatorname{inc}(U),\\\\\nr_i&amp;:=|U\\cap i|,\\qquad\\vec u_i:=\\langle x_{\\operatorname{inc}(U\\cap i)(j)}\\rangle_{j&lt;r_i},\\\\\nC_{\\vec f}&amp;:=C\\cup\\{f_i:i\\in E\\land r_i=0\\},\\\\\nF_{\\vec f}&amp;:=F\\cup\\{f_i:i\\in E\\land r_i&gt;0\\},\\\\\na_F^{\\vec f}&amp;:=a_F\\cup\\{\\langle f_i,r_i\\rangle:i\\in E\\land r_i&gt;0\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\vec f}&amp;:=\\langle C_{\\vec f},F_{\\vec f},a_F^{\\vec f},R,a_R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns(x_i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;i\\in U,\\\\\\operatorname{con}(f_i),&amp;i\\in E\\land r_i=0,\\\\f_i(\\vec u_i),&amp;i\\in E\\land r_i&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\\\\nB_0&amp;:=\\theta,\\qquad B_{i+1}:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(B_i,s(x_i),x_i)\\quad(i&lt;n),\\\\\n\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]&amp;:=B_n,\\\\\nK_k&amp;:=B_n,\\qquad K_j:=\\forall x_{e(j)}K_{j+1}\\quad(j&lt;k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)&amp;:=K_0,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C&#39;\\restriction C,I_F&#39;\\restriction F,I_R&#39;\\restriction R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns(x_i)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;i\\in U,\\\\\\operatorname{con}(f_i),&amp;i\\in E\\land r_i=0,\\\\f_i(\\vec u_i),&amp;i\\in E\\land r_i&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\\\\nB_0&amp;:=\\theta,\\qquad B_{i+1}:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(B_i,s(x_i),x_i)\\quad(i&lt;n),\\\\\n\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]&amp;:=B_n,\\\\\nK_k&amp;:=B_n,\\qquad K_j:=\\forall x_{e(j)}K_{j+1}\\quad(j&lt;k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)&amp;:=K_0,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C&#39;\\restriction C,I_F&#39;\\restriction F,I_R&#39;\\restriction R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak M&#39;\\ (\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak M\\land\\mathfrak M&#39;\\models\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak M&#39;\\ (\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak M\\land\\mathfrak M&#39;\\models\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Skolem形是扩充签名中的全称句；等满足性需要扩张/约化，不能写成原语言内等价。ZFC选择公理为每个先行全称参数元组选取见证。书中对有自由参数的Skolem函数定义另含自由参数；此原子限定闭句并按先行全称变量给出实际依赖。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23 全文复核补证：设原结构满足前束句。沿量词前缀从左向右保持不变量：对已经给出的全称参数及已经选定的存在值，剩余量词后缀为真。全称步让参数遍历论域；存在步对每个先行全称参数元组，从使剩余后缀为真的非空见证集合中选一个元素。ZFC 的选择公理给出这一选择函数，先前存在值已经是先行全称参数的函数，故新函数也只需这些参数。有限次递归得到各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i\">\\(f_i\\)</span> 的解释；矩阵代入引理遂给出 Skolem 全称句为真。反向，给定所显示的扩张，在每个存在量词处用相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i\">\\(f_i\\)</span> 在先行全称参数处的值作见证，沿前缀归纳便恢复原句；旧签名上的项与原子真值由约化保持。空前缀时两边都是同一个无量词闭句，零元函数分支使用明确的常元解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$V$ 与公式构造取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]；$X_{\\rm qf}$、结构及满足关系取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。$n\\in\\omega$，$\\vec Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}^n$，$\\vec x\\in V^n$ 为单射，$\\theta\\in X_{\\rm qf}$ 且 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)$。$\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta$，空前缀时 $\\varphi=\\theta$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$V$ 与公式构造取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]；$X_{\\rm qf}$、结构及满足关系取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。$n\\in\\omega$，$\\vec Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}^n$，$\\vec x\\in V^n$ 为单射，$\\theta\\in X_{\\rm qf}$ 且 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)$。$\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta$，空前缀时 $\\varphi=\\theta$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\rm qf}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in V^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in X_{\\rm qf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"U,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec f","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f)\\cap(C\\cup F\\cup R\\cup V)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{inc}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"r_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\vec f}","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"B_0,\\ldots,B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\vec f}","display":false},{"tex":"K_k,\\ldots,K_0","display":false},{"tex":"k-j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M'=\\langle D,I_C',I_F',I_R'\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_{\\vec f}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M'\\upharpoonright\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nU&:=\\{i<n:Q_i=\\forall\\},\\qquad E:=\\{i<n:Q_i=\\exists\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{inc}(J)&:=\\iota h\\in J^{|J|}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(h)=J\\land\\forall a<b<|J|\\ (h(a)<h(b))],\\\\\nk&:=|U|,\\qquad e:=\\operatorname{inc}(U),\\\\\nr_i&:=|U\\cap i|,\\qquad\\vec u_i:=\\langle x_{\\operatorname{inc}(U\\cap i)(j)}\\rangle_{j<r_i},\\\\\nC_{\\vec f}&:=C\\cup\\{f_i:i\\in E\\land r_i=0\\},\\\\\nF_{\\vec f}&:=F\\cup\\{f_i:i\\in E\\land r_i>0\\},\\\\\na_F^{\\vec f}&:=a_F\\cup\\{\\langle f_i,r_i\\rangle:i\\in E\\land r_i>0\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\vec f}&:=\\langle C_{\\vec f},F_{\\vec f},a_F^{\\vec f},R,a_R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ns(x_i)&:=\\begin{cases}x_i,&i\\in U,\\\\\\operatorname{con}(f_i),&i\\in E\\land r_i=0,\\\\f_i(\\vec u_i),&i\\in E\\land r_i>0,\\end{cases}\\\\\nB_0&:=\\theta,\\qquad B_{i+1}:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(B_i,s(x_i),x_i)\\quad(i<n),\\\\\n\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]&:=B_n,\\\\\nK_k&:=B_n,\\qquad K_j:=\\forall x_{e(j)}K_{j+1}\\quad(j<k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)&:=K_0,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M'\\upharpoonright\\Sigma&:=\\langle D,I_C'\\restriction C,I_F'\\restriction F,I_R'\\restriction R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak M'\\ (\\mathfrak M'\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak M\\land\\mathfrak M'\\models\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi))).","display":true},{"tex":"f_i","display":false},{"tex":"f_i","display":false}],"bytes":4380,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-skolemization|df-skolemization — Skolemization]]"},{"id":"67e22e42f3c205d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\chi\\in X_\\Sigma$ 是不含等号原子的闭句。选择与 $\\neg\\chi$ 等价、不含等号原子且量词绑定变量两两互异的闭前束句 $\\varphi$，指定 [[72-df-skolemization]] 的新符号族 $\\vec f$；$\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\theta$。$\\Sigma'$ 是扩充后的五分量签名；若没有闭项，再添一个新常量，故 $\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma'}\\ne\\varnothing$。"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8"]}